Stores customer profiles in the primary database and profile images in object
storage. Nightly database backups are retained by the infrastructure team.

No approved retention period or deletion owner is documented.
# Audit Event Service

Writes authentication and administrative events to an append-only event store.
Selected events are also exported to the analytics warehouse.

Legal-hold behavior and retention requirements have not been decided.
function canAccess(user, document) {
  return user.organizationId === document.organizationId;
}

